  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0005_2396d838974b.png\"><br><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Required area }=2 \\int_0^{\\sqrt{3}}\\left(2 x^2+9-5 x^2\\right) d x \\\\ & =2\\left[9 x-x^3\\right]_0^{\\sqrt{3}}=2[9 \\sqrt{3}-3 \\sqrt{3}]=12 \\sqrt{3} .\\end{aligned}$"
  }
